+! Golden Ratio Bracket Expansion
+! Reference: Numerical Recipes in Fortran 77, 2nd Ed., Section 9.1, p.343
+!            "Initial Bracketing of a Root"
+! Method: Expands bracket geometrically using golden ratio until
+!         function changes sign (F(X1)*F(X2) < 0)
+
+        SUBROUTINE MZPB(X1,X2,Kc,Kr,psi,prel,ihat,coef,coef_nonzero,
+     &                  rad,rhoc,xhat,yhat,zhat,success)
+        IMPLICIT NONE
+        
